OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785242914
OL,3,CPrime Minister to 'bring people back
OL,4,Ctogether' in wake of Henry Nowak murder
OL,6,FAsked what he's planning to do to
OL,7,Fbring communities back together
OL,8,Ffollowing the murder of Henry Nowak,
OL,9,Fthe Prime Minister said: "It's
OL,10,Fobviously something that we need to
OL,11,Fwork hard to do to build those bridges.
OL,13,F"I have some experience of this as
OL,14,FMayor of Greater Manchester when we
OL,15,Fhad the attack at the Manchester Arena
OL,16,Fin 2017 and more recently the attack
OL,17,Fat the Heaton Park Synagogue.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785242914
OL,3,CPrime Minister to 'bring people back
OL,4,Ctogether' in wake of Henry Nowak murder
OL,6,F"I did put a lot of effort into
OL,7,Fbringing different communities back
OL,8,Ftogether and that has to be, you know,
OL,9,Fa national priority going forward."
OL,11,FHenry Nowak, who was 18, was studying
OL,12,Fat Southampton University when he was
OL,13,Fstabbed by Vickrum Digwa in December
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FDigwa, 23, was jailed for life in
OL,17,FJune, with a minimum of 21 years for
OL,18,Fthe murder.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785242914
OL,3,CPrime Minister to 'bring people back
OL,4,Ctogether' in wake of Henry Nowak murder
OL,6,FDigwa's mother, Kiran Kaur, 53, was
OL,7,Fjailed for three years in July for
OL,8,Ftaking the weapon he used back to the
OL,9,Fnearby family home.
OL,11,FThe case sparked outrage and protests,
OL,12,Fwith Hampshire Police facing
OL,13,Faccusations that officers had failed
OL,14,Fto listen to Henry because he was
OL,15,Fwhite.
OL,17,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,18,FConduct (IOPC) said it is
OL,19,Finvestigating potential failures by
OL,20,Fthe officers who attended the scene.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785242914
OL,3,CPrime Minister to 'bring people back
OL,4,Ctogether' in wake of Henry Nowak murder
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister added that the UK
OL,7,Fneeds "a zero tolerance approach to
OL,8,Fhate crime of any kind."
OL,10,F"That's certainly something that I
OL,11,Fworked on with Greater Manchester
OL,12,FPolice and, you know, I think it's
OL,13,Fsomething we should bring through
OL,14,Fnationally," Mr Burnham added.
OL,16,F"If hate crime goes unchecked it can
OL,17,Fcause real fear in communities and we
OL,18,Fcan't have that.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785242914
OL,3,CPrime Minister to 'bring people back
OL,4,Ctogether' in wake of Henry Nowak murder
OL,6,F"I realise it's been difficult in
OL,7,FSouthampton in recent weeks and
OL,8,Fmonths, but I would want to support
OL,9,Four Members of Parliament in
OL,10,FSouthampton and Portsmouth to bring
OL,11,Fpeople back together.
OL,13,F"So I will not be an irregular visitor.
OL,15,F"I'm here in my first week and people
OL,16,Fshould expect to see me back here and
OL,17,Fhopefully before too long."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
